  "comments": "Coins without mintmark dated 1961-1963 were struck in Warsaw; 1973 and 1974 were struck in Kremnica, Czechoslovakia and denoted (kr); with mint mark under left leg (to the right for observer) struck in Warsaw and denoted MW.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d9ecf7a234da.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d9ecf7a234da.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\nA few groups of obverse are known.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - details closer to center, thick script of circular legend.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span> - details closer to rim, thin script of circular legend, feathers of tail far from claws, wide rim.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span> - details closer to rim, thin script of circular legend, feathers of tail touch claws, narrow rim .<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span> - details closer to rim, thick script of circular legend.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61c63585d5c2e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61c63585d5c2e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"217\" /></a><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Note</span>. Date each year is different from others obviously, though in early emission similar styles were found. The coins with short nose to &#039;1&#039; are known in 1961-1967, 1970-1972 (see photo above); &#039;1&#039; with long thin nose curved top are known in 1973 (both mints), 1974 and 1975 (see photo above); &#039;1&#039; with long thin nose curved down present on coins 1976-1978 (see photo above); in general thick date and open &#039;9&#039; is met on coins 1979 and 1980; being the rest dates 1968, 1969, 1981, 1983 and 1985 of original style.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>: 1961-1963, 1965-1972.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>: 1973 MW, 1973 (kr), 1974, 1975.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span>: 1976-1978.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span>: 1979, 1979 PS, 1980, 1980 PS, 1981, 1981 PS, 1983, 1985.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Abbreviation</span><br />\r\nPS - Proof set.",
